{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["The sense of <b>to add to you its yield.</b> It is joined with the consecrated praise-offerings. And if it is far away, likewise \"he shall pay in full.\" And if he has nothing, it is joined with \"five head of cattle — he shall pay instead of the ox.\" And many like these." "The sense of <b>I am YHWH your Elohim.</b> That I will add blessing to the yield."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:02.555001875Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}